      "content": "The thing is, we can't really \"mix and match\" the weights. It's an all-or-nothing reset to ensure there's no leftover \"personality\" bleeding into the new scripts. The sponsors want a clean slate so there's zero risk of the character saying something unexpected or off-brand. It’s better to just go back to the base model and rebuild the dialogue style from the ground up with the new guidelines.",
